sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Srv as Server + ML (ranks, Ch 87 variant)
    participant Feed as RecommendationsFeed (Ch 71)
    participant UI as Rec UI
    participant Log as SignalLogger (Ch 14)

    Srv-->>Feed: ranked personalized items (+ explanations)
    Feed->>UI: render server order (NO re-rank)
    UI->>Log: impression(item, position) when VISIBLE
    User->>UI: tap / dwell / add-to-cart / "not interested"
    UI->>Log: click / dwell / conversion / dismiss
    Log->>Srv: batched signals (Ch 14) -> train models
    Note over Srv: better future ranking
